@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
title One setting with a temporary overlay (§5.2)

[*] --> Ordinary
Ordinary : effective = latest ordinary value
Ordinary --> Overlaid : temporary event\n(lifetime Run or Until(DateTime))
Overlaid : effective = temporary value
Overlaid : return target = previous\nvalidated ordinary value
Overlaid --> Ordinary : expiry, end of Run, or cancellation\n(restore return target)
Overlaid --> Ordinary : new ordinary value\n(overlay removed in the same event)
Overlaid --> Overlaid : second temporary request:\nrejected
Overlaid --> Unavailable : return fails
Unavailable : not recorded as a successful return;\nreported as unavailable
@enduml
